  triage:title "just lint pytests fails: smoke probe test still mocks two Path.is_file calls after d3a601ab0 removed the early return" ;
  triage:description "feature/aw2-sqlite-diagnostic-timeline at d3a601ab0 (fix(smoke): rebuild sqlite writer probe per run, the AW2-QA-HARNESS-001 fix) deleted the if probe.is_file() early return in scripts/smoke/run_admission_capacity.py sqlite_writer_probe, but scripts/smoke/test_run_admission_capacity.py line 333 test_sqlite_probe_build_is_separate_from_the_released_daemon_pair still patches Path.is_file with side_effect [False, True]; the single remaining is_file call now receives False and the probe raises SmokeError no executable produced. Reproduced locally: 1 failed, 106 passed. Pushed without a full just lint run. Fix: update the test to the new single-call contract and make it assert the probe is rebuilt on every run (the behaviour AW2-QA-HARNESS-001 asked for), so the test proves the fix rather than the old caching path." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-aw" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
